WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.899
Codex is running tests.

00:00:02.199 --> 00:00:03.884
Claude is writing code.

00:00:04.184 --> 00:00:07.299
Antigravity is working on another project.

00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:11.832
But one's been waiting for you. And you don't even know which one.

00:00:12.132 --> 00:00:13.305
Meet Loom.

00:00:13.605 --> 00:00:18.384
One place to see what your AI coding agents are doing on your Mac.

00:00:18.796 --> 00:00:21.228
Every project. Every session.

00:00:21.528 --> 00:00:25.560
Working. Waiting. Idle. Finished.

00:00:25.972 --> 00:00:27.444
See what's happening.

00:00:27.744 --> 00:00:29.643
Know what needs your attention.

00:00:29.943 --> 00:00:32.055
And get right back to what matters.

00:00:32.355 --> 00:00:35.150
Get alerted before your quota runs out.

00:00:36.407 --> 00:00:38.284
See where your storage goes.

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:41.848
Keep everything in view with native Mac widgets.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:45.341
No cloud account. Just your Mac.

00:00:45.641 --> 00:00:50.441
Codex. Claude Code. Antigravity. Three agents. One clear view.

00:00:50.803 --> 00:00:53.000
Loom. Your agents, at a glance.
